Único uso, confirmado. Propongo el fix.

```json
{"file": "src/packages/config/plugin/pluginLoader.ts",
 "edits": [{"old": "  // 3. Load built-in plugins that ship with the CLI
  const builtinResult = getBuiltinPlugins()

  // Session plugins (--plugin-dir) override installed ones by name,
  // UNLESS the installed plugin is locked by managed settings
  // (policySettings). See mergePluginSources() for details.
  const { plugins: allPlugins, errors: mergeErrors } = mergePluginSources({
    session: sessionResult.plugins,
    marketplace: marketplaceResult.plugins,
    builtin: [...builtinResult.enabled, ...builtinResult.disabled],
    managedNames: getManagedPluginNames(),
  })",
           "new": "  // 3. Load built-in plugins that ship with the CLI
  const builtinResult = getBuiltinPlugins()
  // getBuiltinPlugins() declara enabled/disabled como unknown[] en _deps.ts
  // (seam de DI para romper el ciclo con builtin.ts), pero en tiempo de
  // ejecución setGetBuiltinPluginsFn() lo conecta con la implementación real
  // de builtin.ts, que siempre construye objetos LoadedPlugin.
  const builtinPlugins = [
    ...builtinResult.enabled,
    ...builtinResult.disabled,
  ] as LoadedPlugin[]

  // Session plugins (--plugin-dir) override installed ones by name,
  // UNLESS the installed plugin is locked by managed settings
  // (policySettings). See mergePluginSources() for details.
  const { plugins: allPlugins, errors: mergeErrors } = mergePluginSources({
    session: sessionResult.plugins,
    marketplace: marketplaceResult.plugins,
    builtin: builtinPlugins,
    managedNames: getManagedPluginNames(),
  })"}],
 "patterns": [{"patron": "di-seam-unknown-array-from-deps",
               "senal_del_verificador": "getBuiltinPlugins\(\)|is not assignable to type 'LoadedPlugin(\[\])?'",
               "fix_generico": "Cuando un valor viene de un seam de DI en _deps.ts tipado como unknown[]/unknown (para romper un ciclo de imports), y la implementación real conectada en runtime (via su setXxxFn) construye el tipo real, se declara una variable intermedia con `as <TipoReal>` acompañada de un comentario que nombra el seam y su implementación real — no se toca _deps.ts ni se usa `as any`/`as unknown as`.",
               "edits": [0]}],
 "fixes": ["src/packages/config/plugin/pluginLoader.ts(3191,5): error TS2322: Type 'unknown[]' is not assignable to type 'LoadedPlugin[]'."],
 "skipped": []}
```
